; TITLE - LCD-off redraw (gbe_screen) in the BG map, SCX=SCY=0, window off, sprites off.
; Rows 0-1: earth ceiling (the tower is underground). Rows 3-4: "TORRE" logo (16 LOGO tiles,
; cols 5-14). Row 6: "H U N D I D A" in the font, spaced. Row 8: the master's staff.
; Rows 10/12: menu, BG cursor tile at col 3 beside the selected option. CONTINUAR only if
; save_load() found a valid game: otherwise the code blanks it (SCREEN_TITLE_LEN_CONTINUAR
; tiles) and the cursor stays on NUEVA PARTIDA. With a save the cursor starts on CONTINUAR.
; Row 14: year. Rows 15-17: the tower's top, upside down (bricks, battlements hanging down).
